### ====================================================================
###  Plateforme de gestion des stages - jeu de tests complet
###
###  IntelliJ : cliquez sur la fleche verte a gauche de chaque requete.
###  Les jetons sont captures automatiquement, executez les requetes
###  d'authentification (section 1) AVANT le reste.
### ====================================================================

@gateway = http://localhost:8090
@json = application/json

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTIFICATION - a executer en premier
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Connexion ADMIN
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "admin@esprit.tn", "password": "Admin@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenAdmin", response.body.token); %}

### 1.2 Connexion ETUDIANT
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "ahmed.bensalah@esprit.tn", "password": "Etudiant@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenEtudiant", response.body.token); %}

### 1.3 Connexion ENTREPRISE
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "soc.tech@partner.tn", "password": "Entreprise@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenEntreprise", response.body.token); %}

### 1.4 Connexion ENCADRANT
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "encadrant@partner.tn", "password": "Encadrant@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenEncadrant", response.body.token); %}

### 1.5 Connexion CHEF DEPARTEMENT STAGE
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "chef.stages@esprit.tn", "password": "ChefStage@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenChefStage", response.body.token); %}

### 1.6 Connexion CHEF DEPARTEMENT PEDAGOGIQUE
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "chef.pedago@esprit.tn", "password": "ChefPedago@2026" }

> {% client.global.set("tokenPedago", response.body.token); %}

### 1.7 Profil du porteur du jeton
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 1.8 Inscription d'un nouveau compte
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "email": "nouveau.etudiant@esprit.tn",
  "password": "Etudiant@2026",
  "firstName": "Sarra",
  "lastName": "Jelassi",
  "role": "ETUDIANT"
}

### 1.9 NEGATIF - mauvais mot de passe (attendu 401)
POST {{gateway}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "email": "admin@esprit.tn", "password": "faux" }

### 1.10 NEGATIF - sans jeton (attendu 401)
GET {{gateway}}/api/auth/me

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PROFILS  (user-service)
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Profil etudiant
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 2.2 Creer le profil etudiant (409 s'il existe deja)
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "firstName": "Ahmed",
  "lastName": "Ben Salah",
  "email": "ahmed.bensalah@esprit.tn",
  "phone": "20123456",
  "cin": "12345678",
  "classe": "4SAE3",
  "departement": "Genie Logiciel"
}

### 2.3 Liste des etudiants - CHEF DEPT STAGE (attendu 200)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/students?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}

### 2.4 NEGATIF - un ETUDIANT liste tous les etudiants (attendu 403)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/students
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 2.5 Profil entreprise
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/companies/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEntreprise}}

### 2.6 Annuaire des entreprises
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 2.7 Encadrants proposables a l'etudiant (projection sans email ni telephone)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/companies/1/supervisors/options
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 2.7b Fiches completes des encadrants, par l'entreprise proprietaire
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/companies/1/supervisors
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEntreprise}}

### 2.7c NEGATIF - un ETUDIANT lit les fiches completes (attendu 403)
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/companies/1/supervisors
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 2.8 Profil encadrant
GET {{gateway}}/api/users/supervisors/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}

### 2.9 NEGATIF - un ENCADRANT declare un encadrant (attendu 403)
POST {{gateway}}/api/users/supervisors
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "userId": 99, "firstName": "X", "lastName": "Y", "email": "x@y.tn", "phone": "", "position": "" }

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. MODULE 1 - DEMANDES ET WORKFLOW  (internship-service)
###    Executez 3.1 a 3.9 dans l'ordre : chaque transition depend
###    de la precedente.
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 ETUDIANT cree un brouillon
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "type": "PFE",
  "title": "Plateforme de gestion des stages",
  "description": "Microservices Spring Boot et frontend Angular",
  "academicYear": "2026-2027",
  "companyId": 1,
  "companyName": "SocieteTech Partner",
  "requestedSupervisorId": 2,
  "startDate": "2026-07-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31"
}

> {% client.global.set("stageId", response.body.id); %}

### 3.2 ETUDIANT soumet la demande  (DRAFT -> SUBMITTED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "SUBMITTED" }

### 3.3 CHEF prend en charge  (SUBMITTED -> UNDER_REVIEW)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "UNDER_REVIEW" }

### 3.4 NEGATIF - l'ETUDIANT tente d'approuver (attendu 403)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "APPROVED" }

### 3.5 NEGATIF - refus sans motif (attendu 400)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "REJECTED" }

### 3.6 CHEF approuve  (UNDER_REVIEW -> APPROVED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "APPROVED" }

### 3.7 NEGATIF - saut d'etape vers ACCEPTED (attendu 409)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "ACCEPTED" }

### 3.8 CHEF transmet a l'entreprise  (APPROVED -> COMPANY_PENDING)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "COMPANY_PENDING" }

### 3.9 ENTREPRISE accepte et designe l'encadrant  (-> ACCEPTED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEntreprise}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "ACCEPTED", "supervisorId": 1, "supervisorName": "Youssef Gharbi" }

### 3.10 Demarrage du stage  (ACCEPTED -> IN_PROGRESS)
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/transition
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEntreprise}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "target": "IN_PROGRESS" }

### 3.11 Detail du dossier : etat, actions possibles, historique complet
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}

### 3.12 Mes stages (etudiant)
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 3.13 Stages de mon entreprise
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/company
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEntreprise}}

### 3.14 Stages que j'encadre
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/supervision
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}

### 3.15 Tous les stages du departement
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/department
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}

### 3.16 Statistiques par etat
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}

### 3.17 ETUDIANT demande une lettre d'affectation
POST {{gateway}}/api/internships/{{stageId}}/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "type": "LETTRE_AFFECTATION" }

> {% client.global.set("demandeId", response.body.id); %}

### 3.18 Demandes en attente
GET {{gateway}}/api/internships/requests/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}

### 3.19 CHEF edite la lettre
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/internships/requests/{{demandeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenChefStage}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "status": "ISSUED" }

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. MODULE 2 - JOURNAL DE STAGE  (evaluation-service)
###    Le stage doit etre IN_PROGRESS (section 3 jusqu'a 3.10).
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 ETUDIANT saisit une tache
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "taskDate": "2026-08-17",
  "title": "Mise en place du pipeline CI",
  "description": "GitHub Actions, build Maven et execution des tests",
  "hours": 7
}

> {% client.global.set("tacheId", response.body.id); %}

### 4.2 Deuxieme tache
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "taskDate": "2026-08-18",
  "title": "Dockerisation des services",
  "description": "Dockerfiles multi-stage et docker-compose",
  "hours": 6.5
}

### 4.3 NEGATIF - tache dans le futur (attendu 400)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "taskDate": "2027-12-01", "title": "Tache future", "description": "", "hours": 4 }

### 4.4 NEGATIF - duree de 20 heures (attendu 400)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "taskDate": "2026-08-19", "title": "Journee trop longue", "description": "", "hours": 20 }

### 4.5 Journal du stage
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}

### 4.6 ENCADRANT valide une tache
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/tasks/{{tacheId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "status": "VALIDATED" }

### 4.7 NEGATIF - refus sans motif (attendu 400)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/tasks/{{tacheId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "status": "REJECTED" }

### 4.8 NEGATIF - l'ETUDIANT valide sa propre tache (attendu 403)
PATCH {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/tasks/{{tacheId}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "status": "VALIDATED" }

### 4.9 Synthese du journal
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/tasks/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. MODULE 2 - GRILLE ET NOTE
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 ENCADRANT remplit la grille  (16/15/16/15/16 -> 15,75)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "technicalScore": 16,
  "qualityScore": 15,
  "autonomyScore": 16,
  "communicationScore": 15,
  "punctualityScore": 16,
  "globalComment": "Stagiaire autonome et rigoureux, bonne maitrise des outils DevOps.",
  "remarks": "A encourager a documenter davantage ses choix techniques."
}

### 5.2 NEGATIF - l'ETUDIANT lit sa note avant validation (attendu 403)
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 5.3 ENCADRANT valide la grille : la note devient definitive
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEncadrant}}

### 5.4 ETUDIANT voit sa note et le detail du calcul
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 5.5 Statistiques des notes
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. EXPORTS
###    IntelliJ propose d'enregistrer le fichier binaire renvoye.
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Export XLSX des notes
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/export/xlsx
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}

### 6.2 Journal de stage en PDF
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/internships/{{stageId}}/journal/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. RECLAMATION AVEC BOUCLAGE
###    Executez 7.1 a 7.7 dans l'ordre.
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 ETUDIANT ouvre une reclamation
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "internshipId": {{stageId}},
  "type": "NOTE",
  "subject": "Contestation de la note de stage",
  "message": "Je conteste la note d'assiduite : mes retards etaient justifies par un certificat medical."
}

> {% client.global.set("reclamationId", response.body.id); %}

### 7.2 CHEF PEDAGO prend en charge  (OPEN -> IN_REVIEW)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/take
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}

### 7.3 CHEF PEDAGO repond  (-> RESPONDED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Apres verification aupres de l'encadrant, deux retards ne sont pas justifies." }

### 7.4 ETUDIANT relance : LE BOUCLAGE  (-> REOPENED, reopenCount +1)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Je joins le certificat medical couvrant ces deux journees, pouvez-vous reexaminer ?" }

### 7.5 CHEF PEDAGO repond de nouveau  (-> RESPONDED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Certificat pris en compte, la note d'assiduite est revue a la hausse." }

### 7.6 NEGATIF - l'ETUDIANT tente de cloturer (attendu 403)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Je cloture" }

### 7.7 CHEF PEDAGO cloture  (-> CLOSED)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Dossier clos, la note corrigee est enregistree." }

### 7.8 NEGATIF - message sur une reclamation close (attendu 400)
POST {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{ "content": "Une derniere question" }

### 7.9 Fil complet de la reclamation
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/{{reclamationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}

### 7.10 Mes reclamations (etudiant)
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenEtudiant}}

### 7.11 Reclamations a traiter
GET {{gateway}}/api/evaluations/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenPedago}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. INFRASTRUCTURE
### --------------------------------------------------------------

### 8.1 Sante du gateway
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### 8.2 Registre Eureka (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/json

### 8.3 Configuration servie a internship-service
GET http://localhost:8888/internship-service/default
